title: "RuralLink: Adaptive Uplink Coverage Simulator"
abstract: "Reproducible Python link-level simulator for uplink coverage limits and joint adaptive modulation–bandwidth allocation at 900/1800 MHz in Indonesian 3T regions (Group 1, Digital Communication Systems)."
